     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Key idea",
     "texto": [
      "In verbs and adjectives with ㅡ, this vowel disappears before 아/어. If the previous syllable has ㅏ or ㅗ, 아 is used; with other vowels 어 is used: 바쁘다→바빠요, 예쁘다→예뻐요. With one-syllable stems, 어 is usually used: 쓰다→써요, 크다→커요.",
      "편지를 써요. = I write a letter."
     ],
